      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HARA'S MOSAIC (2) finds it hard to win. Finished in the minors latest when third (25.90) at this track and may be close to breaking through. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings three times from four starts. Leading chance again. GEORGIA SKIES (7) was responsible for a modest effort most recently when sixth at this track over 390m behind Flyaway Jack (22.29) in a Grade 5. Placed at her previous run. Cannot be underestimated. TOO SNEAKY (1) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing eighth (22.75) in a Grade 5 at this track. Expected to feature in the finish. DAWN SURE CAN (3) is a last-start placegetter who should be thereabouts.",
